  "chapter": 18,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD appeared to him in the plains of Mamre: and he sat in the tent door in the heat of the day;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he lifted up his eyes and looked, and lo, three men stood by him: and when he saw ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", he ran to meet them from the tent door, and bowed himself toward the ground,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And said, My Lord, if now I have found favor in thy sight, pass not away, I pray thee, from thy servant:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let a little water, I pray you, be brought, and wash your feet, and rest yourselves under the tree:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I will bring a morsel of bread, and comfort ye your hearts; after that you shall pass on: for therefore are ye come to your servant. And they said, So do, as thou hast said.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abraham hastened into the tent to Sarah, and said, Make ready quickly three measures of fine meal, knead ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and make cakes upon the hearth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abraham ran to the herd, and brought a calf tender and good, and gave ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to a young man; and he hasted to dress it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
