      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he took butter, and milk, and the calf which he had dressed, and set ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before them; and he stood by them under the tree, and they ate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And they said to him, Where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Sarah thy wife? And he said, Behold, in the tent.",
