      "id": "GEN.18.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will go down now, and see whether they have done altogether according to the cry of it, which is come to me; and if not, I will know.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the men turned their faces from thence, and went towards Sodom: but Abraham stood yet before the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Abraham drew near, and said, Wilt thou also destroy the righteous with the wicked?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEN.18.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:GEN.18.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Peradventure there are fifty righteous within the city: wilt thou also destroy and not spare the place for the fifty righteous that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in it?",
          "kind": "text"
